siness to a third party. In November 2025, we announced a new partnership with Shannon Doherty, creator of At Home with Shannon, to introduce a new collection designed to bring warmth, style, and functionality to every home.","context":"Longaberger","section":"Item 1. Business","block":92,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-043348","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001083220","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083220/000110465926043348/xelb-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09.bin","sha256":"0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09"}},{"id":"87c7078b47a3e231c50cebde06bc5b9a0763ddd56ef1803d7dae6ca8adb624bf","quote":"TowerHill by Christie Brinkley is a co-branded collaboration between Xcel Brands, Inc. and Christie Lee Brinkley, an iconic American supermodel with over one million followers on social media. The brand launched on HSN in May 2024.","context":"TowerHill by Christie Brinkley","section":"Item 1. Business","block":94,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-043348","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001083220","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083220/000110465926043348/xelb-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09.bin","sha256":"0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09"}},{"id":"c9648338ec3826aecc592c71e0078dd13c189b62f8b5c8218e4f9c7d71ba9aa2","quote":"This brand is a co-branded collaboration between Xcel Brands, Inc. and renowned dog behaviorist Cesar Millan. This innovative brand will offer a range of high-quality pet products, including toys and training tools, aimed at enhanci