ome influencer Jenny Martinez, for which Xcel holds the television rights through a long-term license agreement. This brand is a dynamic new food brand inspired by the bold flavors, rich traditions, and spirit of Latin cooking, and will offer a curated line of food products designed to bring delicious, authentic meals to the kitchens of Jenny’s fans with ease and flair. The brand is expected to launch on TSC in Spring 2026.","section":"Item 1. Business","block":105,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-043348","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001083220","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083220/000110465926043348/xelb-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09.bin","sha256":"0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09"}},{"id":"e39a5d64ff6c6d076601778cec194b832498d67fb55968b624fcae795c34b9dc","quote":"We plan to continue to grow our brands and business through three primary strategies:","context":"Growth Strategy","section":"Item 1. Business","block":107,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-043348","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-04-15","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001083220","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1083220/000110465926043348/xelb-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09.bin","sha256":"0b0a8f8d4dbfba528598f52fcc783f8e4a9691939edc3ae4905c0bee51370a09"}},{"id":"b55a70e6ef87498bad87fc54297994268561b7e57d254400adc05aa3c10aeccc","quote":"●developing new brands that are well positioned in social commerce; and","context":"●organic growth in our existing brands;","section":"Item 1. Business","block":109,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure"